WEBVTT

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:05.000
"Pedestrian and Bicycle Traffic Only"

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:05.000
Seriously, seriously!

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.840
This is totally Destiny on the Asagaya!

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:10.710
Not interested.

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:14.180
Sadness on the Asagaya...

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.680
Oh, my gosh! It's a pick-up artist!

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:18.380
Shakurako's scared!

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:20.350
Manager, let's move along.

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:24.020
Shoko, would you come find destiny with me?

00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:26.050
I'll treat you to the latest sweets.

00:00:26.050 --> 00:00:27.550
What?

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:35.920
Yes?

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:40.700
Nothing.

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:45.210
Destiny on the Asagaya!

00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:49.910
In this event, couples travel around town on a stamp rally date!

00:00:49.480 --> 00:01:00.220
"Destiny on the Asagaya

00:00:49.480 --> 00:01:00.220
Stamp Rally Date

00:00:49.480 --> 00:01:00.220
Overcome the trials of love!

00:00:49.480 --> 00:01:00.220
Win incredible prizes!"

00:00:49.910 --> 00:00:51.610
The location is here in Asagaya.

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:54.750
For the best couple, who will have overcome many hurdles,

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:56.720
there's a set of couples tickets!

00:00:56.720 --> 00:01:00.790
What? Who does Karan love?
All of you, my fans!

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:02.960
Is this a new type of reading theater?

00:01:02.960 --> 00:01:05.060
I'm the presenter for an upcoming event.

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:07.400
H-Hey!

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:10.800
Maia, we're joining, too!

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:14.740
"Matching Crowns

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:14.740
(Crown of the Sovereign)"

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:13.440
This belongs on the head of a savior!

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:14.740
Matching crowns?

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:16.570
They're just toys, you know?

00:01:16.570 --> 00:01:18.440
We just need one boy and girl, right?

00:01:18.440 --> 00:01:20.940
Ah, a fake couple, huh?

00:01:20.940 --> 00:01:22.640
What's that?

00:01:23.910 --> 00:01:26.280
You'll pretend to be lovers.

00:01:26.280 --> 00:01:29.080
Pretend to be lovers?

00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:38.530
<i>The world is engulfed by an unvoiced scream</i>

00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:44.470
<i>and I wait for it to reach and stir</i> <i>a certain someone's heart</i>

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:50.270
<i>With strength flowing to the edges of our souls</i>

00:01:50.270 --> 00:01:56.540
<i>we set out into the white</i> <i>morning haze, without hesitation</i>

00:01:56.540 --> 00:01:59.480
<i>I want to know everything about you</i>

00:01:59.480 --> 00:02:09.480
<i>But just when I thought</i>
<i>I had you, you were gone</i>

00:02:14.330 --> 00:02:18.570
<i>It's love, affection, passion, expression</i>

00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:25.170
<i>These tightly-sealed, silent lips</i>

00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:29.540
<i>gently reply back in kind</i>

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:33.820
<i>And with love, affection, passion, expression</i>

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:40.320
<i>Now, from the last of the words I couldn't find,</i>

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:49.030
<i>the music begins</i>

00:03:00.510 --> 00:03:04.080
"Fall in Love! Asagaya"

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:06.180
What?! Why?!

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:09.220
It's not just for the event-- you're really going out?

00:03:09.220 --> 00:03:11.690
With Tsutomu? Why?!

00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:15.390
That's just how it turned out...

00:03:14.860 --> 00:03:26.700
"Destiny on the Asagaya

00:03:14.860 --> 00:03:26.700
Stamp Rally Date"

00:03:15.390 --> 00:03:19.690
This event is a total ripoff.
They're infringing on my copyright!

00:03:19.690 --> 00:03:21.200
Who cares?

00:03:21.200 --> 00:03:24.100
I'm okay with it. I don't have a shift that day, anyway.

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:26.700
Shoko, I love you so much!

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:29.400
And since we're doing this, we should go out, too!

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:30.930
Sure.

00:03:33.610 --> 00:03:34.880
Seriously?!

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:37.880
There are things I won't know about you until we've gone out.

00:03:37.880 --> 00:03:41.220
It's always possible I could fall for you after we start going out.

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:45.220
But, until we're both truly in love with each other,

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:47.390
we won't be doing any of that stuff.

00:03:47.390 --> 00:03:49.060
S-Sure!

00:03:49.060 --> 00:03:52.430
Shoko, you're quite mature.

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:53.630
I see!

00:03:53.630 --> 00:03:55.100
W-Wow...

00:03:55.100 --> 00:03:58.230
What's "that stuff"?

00:03:58.230 --> 00:03:59.830
Um...

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:03.910
--Like kissing!
--Kissing.

00:04:03.910 --> 00:04:05.070
Or hugging.

00:04:05.070 --> 00:04:07.070
Hugging! Anything else?

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:10.610
Uh, and other pervy stuff?

00:04:10.610 --> 00:04:13.620
Pervy stuff! Please, explain in detail.

00:04:13.620 --> 00:04:18.090
Oh, gosh! Maia, you silly!

00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:19.580
What?!

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:27.100
Madam.

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:28.790
George.

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:33.940
What is this?

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:36.940
You know, kissing! Kissing!

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:40.140
You kiss the person you love like this!

00:04:40.140 --> 00:04:41.140
Madam.

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:42.780
The person you love...

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:48.450
Overseas, it can just be a greeting, but these two really are lovers.

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:50.790
Lovers.

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:55.790
No way! I-I have to do this stuff?! With Akira?!

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:59.130
No, no. You two can just pretend.

00:04:59.130 --> 00:05:01.630
But, if I take it so half-heartedly, our opponents will...

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:04.130
You just have to look like a couple!

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:06.630
I... I see.

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:08.830
I need to make sure no one catches on.

00:05:10.540 --> 00:05:11.810
Kokone?

00:05:11.810 --> 00:05:14.170
I-I'll go make some tea.

00:05:22.320 --> 00:05:23.690
Is the tea not ready yet?

00:05:23.690 --> 00:05:26.090
Oh, s-sorry...

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:29.480
Will you go instead, Kikogami?

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:33.900
You seem better suited to it.

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:39.230
You've perused a large number of such videos, studying love every day, right?

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:44.240
Oh, but that's... j-just because I like them.

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:50.680
I-I couldn't. A-Akira asked you to join him.

00:05:50.680 --> 00:05:53.210
There isn't a thought in his head.

00:05:53.210 --> 00:05:58.080
B-But he chose you...

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:03.060
Y-You must want it, too...

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:05.190
Want what?

00:06:05.190 --> 00:06:10.360
H-How do you feel about Akira?

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:15.040
He's a pain.

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:19.240
If you don't keep an eye on him, there's no telling what he'll do! He's dangerous!

00:06:19.240 --> 00:06:21.710
So I worry about him, I guess...

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:25.710
Thanks to that, he's always on my mind.

00:06:25.710 --> 00:06:27.710
That's...

00:06:33.550 --> 00:06:38.890
I wonder... if Akira... feels the same.

00:06:38.890 --> 00:06:45.060
H-He's... always looking at you... after all. He helps you, too...

00:06:46.070 --> 00:06:47.970
It's not just me.

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:52.570
He'll save anyone.

00:06:52.570 --> 00:06:54.630
Because he's a savior.

00:07:05.750 --> 00:07:07.980
Sorry, did I keep you waiting?

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:12.260
Ow...

00:07:12.260 --> 00:07:15.800
We have no clue where the event managers could be monitoring us from.

00:07:15.800 --> 00:07:19.170
As soon as they realize we aren't a couple, we'll be disqualified!

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.640
Sorry, did I keep you waiting?

00:07:23.640 --> 00:07:25.940
No, I just got here.

00:07:25.940 --> 00:07:28.340
Good enough. That gets a passing mark.

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:30.140
What are you two doing short skits for?

00:07:30.140 --> 00:07:31.650
Good morning!

00:07:31.650 --> 00:07:34.280
Look! It's her school uniform coordinated for our date!

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:36.950
I don't know about "coordinated."
It's just a school uniform.

00:07:36.950 --> 00:07:38.950
That's the point!

00:07:38.950 --> 00:07:41.790
A schoolgirl's Sunday best has to be her uniform, you know?

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:44.960
Should we go get our pilot suits, too?

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:46.030
Are we launching?

00:07:46.030 --> 00:07:48.830
You're far too loud for this early in the morning.

00:07:48.830 --> 00:07:54.000
Hey, it's Hayato! You came to see our lovey-dovey antics, huh?

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:56.140
You're smothering me!

00:07:56.140 --> 00:07:57.810
We will be participating, as well.

00:07:57.810 --> 00:08:00.310
"We"?

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:03.810
G-Good morning...

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:06.710
You've got some nerve, taking Kokone like this.

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:08.350
Isn't she a bit outside your strike zone?

00:08:08.350 --> 00:08:12.020
Who are you calling a lolicon?
Karan asked me to do this!

00:08:12.020 --> 00:08:14.390
The Crown of the Sovereign will belong to me!

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:17.260
I think you're about the only one aiming for the crowns....

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:29.900
At each checkpoint, there will be many trials of love!

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:31.840
However...!

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:36.880
For a lovey-dovey couple, no trial is insurmountable!

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:38.040
"Destiny on the Asagaya"

00:08:38.350 --> 00:08:40.350
Trials...

00:08:40.350 --> 00:08:42.680
Shoko, let's cheer, too!

00:08:43.680 --> 00:08:47.260
Depending on your degree of success, you'll earn more points.

00:08:47.260 --> 00:08:48.720
So try your best!

00:08:48.720 --> 00:08:53.530
The pair with the highest point total will be Best Couple!

00:08:53.530 --> 00:08:58.400
Now, let Destiny on the Asagaya begin!

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:04.240
Shoko, Shoko! Here.

00:09:04.240 --> 00:09:08.080
Fine, but suddenly holding hands like a couple is a bit off-putting.

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:09.380
Right...

00:09:09.380 --> 00:09:12.580
We are the best couple in Asagaya!

00:09:12.580 --> 00:09:14.550
--Are you?
--What?

00:09:14.550 --> 00:09:16.720
Don't you want the couples tickets?!

00:09:16.720 --> 00:09:18.720
I want to be third.

00:09:18.720 --> 00:09:21.420
The real lovers are impressive!

00:09:21.420 --> 00:09:24.130
They're very lover-ish.

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:26.220
How should we attack this?

00:09:27.900 --> 00:09:31.770
Big Brother, take care of Kokone for me.

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:32.900
I will.

00:09:32.900 --> 00:09:34.630
We should get going.

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:43.080
Akira, it seems lovers hold hands.

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:47.780
I don't think we need to go that far.

00:09:47.780 --> 00:09:51.250
It's not like we're being monitored constantly.

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:54.420
Is that right? Well, okay, then.

00:09:57.430 --> 00:09:59.090
Maia?

00:09:59.090 --> 00:10:01.160
No...

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:05.500
I wonder what the trials of love are like...

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:10.610
I don't know, but if it comes to it, I'll save you.

00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:13.670
For I am the savior!

00:10:14.680 --> 00:10:17.780
You're always like this!

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:20.680
Listen, don't save me today!

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:25.840
Why not?

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:38.830
I love you!

00:10:38.830 --> 00:10:40.030
What is he doing?

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:41.300
What youth!

00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:43.240
I love you!

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:46.640
I love you!

00:10:46.640 --> 00:10:48.880
What incredible Verbalism Ability.

00:10:48.880 --> 00:10:50.480
All they have is volume.

00:10:50.480 --> 00:10:53.210
Kikogami, what are you after?

00:10:53.210 --> 00:10:56.880
Depending on your target, we might do better trying elsewhere.

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:58.650
Let's do this efficiently.

00:11:02.690 --> 00:11:04.390
What are you mad about?

00:11:04.390 --> 00:11:05.830
I'm not mad.

00:11:05.830 --> 00:11:08.330
--You are mad.
--I am <i>not</i> mad!

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:10.330
--I will save you!
--Stop that!

00:11:10.160 --> 00:11:15.200
"Love Trial 2"

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:12.330
Fighting already?

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:16.000
Do you think you can overcome this trial like that?

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:18.170
Here it is, a trial of love!

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:20.170
The trial here is...

00:11:20.170 --> 00:11:23.180
...taking a lovey-dovey pair photograph!

00:11:23.180 --> 00:11:25.380
A lovey-dovey pair photograph?

00:11:25.380 --> 00:11:26.870
Will this do?

00:11:28.550 --> 00:11:30.950
Hey! I'm not in the frame!

00:11:34.090 --> 00:11:35.360
What?!

00:11:35.360 --> 00:11:36.420
I haven't said anything.

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:38.690
Now, now. Let me take it for you.

00:11:38.690 --> 00:11:40.930
Give your boyfriend a hug.

00:11:40.930 --> 00:11:42.520
A hug?

00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:47.530
"Love Trial"

00:11:47.700 --> 00:11:50.440
We got the lowest score possible?

00:11:50.440 --> 00:11:52.440
It still hurts.

00:11:52.440 --> 00:11:53.930
Look out!

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:56.740
Sorry.

00:11:56.740 --> 00:11:59.080
I told you not to save me today!

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:07.960
Are you two being all lovey-dovey?

00:12:07.960 --> 00:12:10.390
Hey, who is this MiyuMiyu?

00:12:10.390 --> 00:12:11.460
Just a friend!

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:13.230
Huh? What kind of friend...

00:12:13.230 --> 00:12:15.400
--What?
--It's a trial of love.

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:18.830
You show one another your cell phones in this one.

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:25.240
"Group General Affairs Cleaning Staff

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:25.240
Sanae Ando

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:25.240
Kahoru Orihashi

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:25.240
Yoshiko Inoue"

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:25.140
Sanae Ando? Yoshiko Inoue? Who are they?

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:27.070
Deava's last line of defense!

00:12:27.070 --> 00:12:28.910
The cleaning ladies, right?

00:12:28.910 --> 00:12:31.440
Can I see your recent exchanges?

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:36.080
"Sorry, I'm going to be late."

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:39.320
"I care not. For I am the savior."

00:12:41.920 --> 00:12:44.430
It's completely incomprehensible!

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:48.760
You're off in your own world!
What high-level roleplaying!

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:51.100
I give it a 20!

00:12:51.100 --> 00:12:52.100
We did it!

00:12:52.100 --> 00:12:53.590
Yeah!

00:12:58.170 --> 00:13:00.440
You scored well there.

00:13:00.440 --> 00:13:03.110
Well, we scored a lovey-dovey 30 points, though!

00:13:03.110 --> 00:13:04.110
Say what?!

00:13:04.110 --> 00:13:08.780
My address book only had Shoko, and my inbox was all her, too!

00:13:08.780 --> 00:13:12.620
You had a lot of sent mail, though. To other girls.

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:15.060
That's from before I was going out with you!

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:20.050
Sanae Ando... Yoshiko Inoue...

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:22.860
You don't have to delete them.

00:13:24.470 --> 00:13:28.200
Trial of love #4! Endure it together!

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:30.700
It's your chance to score points!

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:32.840
It's the princess carry endurance contest!

00:13:32.840 --> 00:13:35.480
How many minutes can you last?

00:13:35.480 --> 00:13:37.480
Sorry I'm so heavy.

00:13:37.480 --> 00:13:40.480
Not at all! If I think of this as the weight of your breasts and butt,

00:13:40.480 --> 00:13:41.520
it's the weight of happiness!

00:13:41.520 --> 00:13:43.480
I really am heavy, then!

00:13:47.050 --> 00:13:48.160
Yes, yes!

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:52.390
The less left at the end, the higher you score!

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:54.400
Shoko!

00:13:54.400 --> 00:13:56.530
You were ready to keep going and kiss me there, weren't you?

00:13:56.530 --> 00:13:58.170
I wouldn't have minded.

00:13:58.170 --> 00:14:00.330
Stay still.

00:14:02.240 --> 00:14:03.670
Aim better!

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:05.870
Cream Puff Russian Roulette!

00:14:05.870 --> 00:14:09.040
If you draw a spicy curry but endure, it's worth 30 points!

00:14:12.680 --> 00:14:13.850
It's sweet.

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:14.850
Thank goodness.

00:14:14.850 --> 00:14:17.920
Curses! A chance to show off my reaction face, wasted!

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:20.350
You really are a born comedian.

00:14:26.360 --> 00:14:27.760
Gonna hurl?

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:31.760
No! This is sweet! Sweet!

00:14:32.900 --> 00:14:34.030
Well, then.

00:14:34.030 --> 00:14:35.770
Let's keep trying hard on the rest of them.

00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:38.070
Sure.

00:14:38.070 --> 00:14:39.710
It's still spicy.

00:14:39.710 --> 00:14:41.740
If you're bad with spicy stuff,
I could have done it instead.

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:44.880
If I didn't eat it myself, that would mean you'd saved me from it.

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:46.750
That's the one thing I don't want.

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:49.750
You don't want to be saved? Why not?

00:14:49.750 --> 00:14:52.250
It makes me kind of... frustrated!

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:54.250
--Why?
--How should I know?

00:14:56.960 --> 00:15:00.230
I don't know, either.

00:15:00.230 --> 00:15:02.800
Maia! Your map!

00:15:02.800 --> 00:15:05.070
Oh, thanks.

00:15:05.070 --> 00:15:06.100
Yeesh.

00:15:06.100 --> 00:15:08.400
Huh? Where'd Akira go?

00:15:32.430 --> 00:15:33.920
Maia!

00:15:36.960 --> 00:15:38.500
Don't wander off on your own.

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:40.500
I could say the same to you!

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:42.140
I thought you'd disappeared.

00:15:42.140 --> 00:15:43.930
I went to the convenience store.

00:15:47.610 --> 00:15:49.800
--100 yen.
--You're charging me?!

00:15:56.280 --> 00:15:58.450
Why don't you want it?

00:15:58.450 --> 00:16:01.290
It's been bothering me since then.

00:16:01.290 --> 00:16:06.190
This isn't like you. Normally, you wouldn't care what I think.

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:08.130
What happened?

00:16:08.130 --> 00:16:10.800
I'm not sure myself.

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:13.830
I see. It's the same for you.

00:16:15.340 --> 00:16:17.310
Could you not lump us together like that?

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:22.340
Since you might wander off again.

00:16:22.340 --> 00:16:23.980
No, you might!

00:16:23.980 --> 00:16:26.210
Let's go.

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:27.480
Hey!

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:29.820
The ranking right now is...

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:32.690
"Destiny on the Asagaya

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:32.690
The Last Trial of Love"

00:16:29.820 --> 00:16:32.020
First: Tsutomu and Shoko!

00:16:32.020 --> 00:16:34.320
Second: Micchi and Yosshi!

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:36.720
Third: Takashi and Yumi!

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:39.060
Fourth: Akira and Maia!

00:16:39.060 --> 00:16:42.060
Keep trying, Big Brother!

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:44.570
Heck, yeah! Let's keep going like this!

00:16:44.570 --> 00:16:47.330
Now, the final trial of love is...

00:16:47.330 --> 00:16:49.540
Find the real Nammy!

00:16:49.540 --> 00:16:51.160
Nammy?

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:56.080
Namisuke's little sister, right?

00:16:56.080 --> 00:16:58.710
Find Nammy within 90 seconds,

00:16:58.710 --> 00:17:02.340
and pull off her trademark flower for 50 points!

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:08.190
Maia, if we win this, we'll be in third!

00:17:08.190 --> 00:17:09.360
You okay?

00:17:09.360 --> 00:17:14.090
Yeah. I'm very familiar with their movement patterns.

00:17:14.090 --> 00:17:15.590
I'll be fine.

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:29.880
A yellow body with a pink flower.

00:17:29.880 --> 00:17:33.210
Nammy has cute eyelashes and loves her brother!

00:17:33.210 --> 00:17:36.380
In her official profile, she's the size of a little dog.

00:17:36.380 --> 00:17:39.790
But different people report different sizes! It's a mystery!

00:17:40.790 --> 00:17:41.920
Is this it?

00:17:41.920 --> 00:17:44.120
The flower is pink! Pink!

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:47.060
45 seconds left! Hurry up!

00:17:47.060 --> 00:17:49.900
A pink flower... Pink...

00:17:53.570 --> 00:17:55.300
If it's come to this, I'll call in backup!

00:17:55.300 --> 00:17:57.290
Deava's last line of defense!

00:18:02.080 --> 00:18:03.740
It's no good! They must be on duty!

00:18:03.740 --> 00:18:05.770
Only 30 seconds remain!

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:10.070
The Aquaripen!

00:18:11.620 --> 00:18:13.250
Destroy! Destroy! Destroy!

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:15.090
It's the last 15 seconds!

00:18:17.420 --> 00:18:19.260
Ten seconds!

00:18:19.260 --> 00:18:20.790
Nine...

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:21.800
Eight...

00:18:21.800 --> 00:18:22.930
Destroy! Destroy! Destroy!

00:18:22.930 --> 00:18:24.930
--Seven...
--Destroy! Destroy! Destroy! Destroy!

00:18:24.930 --> 00:18:26.670
Six...

00:18:26.670 --> 00:18:28.770
--Five...
--Maia! Respond!

00:18:28.770 --> 00:18:30.170
--Four...
--Maia!

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:33.440
Akira! Akira!

00:18:33.440 --> 00:18:35.280
Three...

00:18:35.280 --> 00:18:36.780
Two...

00:18:36.780 --> 00:18:40.310
--One...
--I found it! Heck, yeah!

00:18:47.120 --> 00:18:49.790
Destiny on the Asagaya!

00:18:49.790 --> 00:18:53.790
The victory sadly goes to the team Tsutomu and Shoko!

00:18:53.790 --> 00:18:55.660
What do you mean, "sadly"?!

00:18:59.130 --> 00:19:03.240
These are the couples tickets I've dreamed of.

00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:03.670
"Victory"

00:19:04.470 --> 00:19:07.980
--Shoko!
--Stop.

00:19:07.980 --> 00:19:09.180
Yeah, you're right.

00:19:09.180 --> 00:19:11.310
Everyone's looking right now.

00:19:11.310 --> 00:19:12.850
Yeah.

00:19:12.850 --> 00:19:14.840
Huh? Right now?

00:19:17.020 --> 00:19:20.650
Yikes! It's office love! Office love!

00:19:25.990 --> 00:19:28.860
Akira, at the end, I, uh...

00:19:28.860 --> 00:19:30.590
Put out your hand.

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:34.330
I was being menaced by extraterrestrials...

00:19:36.540 --> 00:19:40.340
I'm sorry we couldn't win the crowns.

00:19:40.340 --> 00:19:42.510
But it was fun.

00:19:42.510 --> 00:19:44.180
Does that mean...?

00:19:44.180 --> 00:19:46.350
What's wrong? Did you hit your head somewhere?

00:19:46.350 --> 00:19:48.840
Should I put my bandage on it for you?

00:19:50.680 --> 00:19:54.880
You're sure you're okay?
It's nothing dangerous, right?

00:19:56.190 --> 00:20:00.790
You wanted to see those two.
Was that your reason for participating?

00:20:02.360 --> 00:20:07.030
I th-thought if I saw them, I could give up.

00:20:07.030 --> 00:20:08.700
B-But...

00:20:08.700 --> 00:20:12.430
I-It still hurts, after all.

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:17.700
You've really changed, Kikogami.

00:20:24.620 --> 00:20:27.820
Now, shout to the one you love!

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:31.960
Akira...

00:20:35.060 --> 00:20:36.720
I love you!

00:20:39.070 --> 00:20:41.940
Kikogami, you've taken a step forward.

00:20:41.940 --> 00:20:46.410
Even if your feelings aren't returned, it hasn't been meaningless.

00:20:46.410 --> 00:20:47.930
That's what I think.

00:20:50.140 --> 00:20:51.740
Thank you.

00:20:53.080 --> 00:20:55.980
In the end, I got saved after all.

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:58.580
You really are a savior.

00:20:59.590 --> 00:21:02.020
I am, but that's not why.

00:21:06.590 --> 00:21:08.650
It's because I wanted to help you.

00:21:13.600 --> 00:21:16.100
--Here.
--Huh? What?

00:21:16.100 --> 00:21:17.140
Oh, right...

00:21:17.140 --> 00:21:18.840
Hey, we're heading back!

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:20.330
Sure!

00:21:37.490 --> 00:21:39.190
What?

00:21:46.800 --> 00:21:48.290
Get lost, you!

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:15.190
Soon he will vanish. And it will be your fault.

00:22:21.100 --> 00:22:26.900
<i>I want to lend you a true voice</i>

00:22:36.950 --> 00:22:42.290
<i>With the warmth of salvation,</i>
<i>I raise my hand into the sky</i>

00:22:42.290 --> 00:22:47.060
<i>and everything in the world gains its true colors</i>

00:22:47.060 --> 00:22:49.730
<i>(Focus) A sound that was once hidden</i>

00:22:49.730 --> 00:22:52.800
<i>(on the goal) will connect us now</i>

00:22:52.800 --> 00:22:55.300
<i>Try to understand that, okay?</i>

00:22:55.300 --> 00:22:57.770
<i>So, are you ready?</i>

00:22:57.770 --> 00:23:00.570
<i>(heart and soul) These silent teardrops</i>

00:23:00.570 --> 00:23:03.140
<i>(narrow escape) that flow forth now</i>

00:23:03.140 --> 00:23:06.650
<i>(enamored) are proof of that person's existence</i>

00:23:06.650 --> 00:23:13.150
<i>You can't go inside your heart all alone</i>

00:23:13.150 --> 00:23:15.760
<i>I will hesitate no more</i>

00:23:15.760 --> 00:23:20.930
<i>I want to lend you a true voice</i>

00:23:20.930 --> 00:23:26.130
<i>A useful life, a sparkling utopia</i>

00:23:26.130 --> 00:23:35.240
<i>When your heart and voice</i> <i>tremble together, you'll surpass all</i>

00:23:35.240 --> 00:23:38.640
<i>So go for your heart</i>

00:23:51.590 --> 00:23:54.590
Oh! It's the singles!

00:23:54.590 --> 00:23:55.600
Good work.

00:23:55.600 --> 00:23:57.130
--You can really see that...
--...he's over the moon.

00:23:57.130 --> 00:23:59.860
I've got me my own "my honey"!

00:24:01.000 --> 00:24:02.670
I have difficulty understanding, for I am--

00:24:02.670 --> 00:24:04.640
Where is my "my darling"?!

00:24:04.640 --> 00:24:07.140
Argh! Next time, Episode 20.

00:24:06.110 --> 00:24:08.380
"Episode 20: Know It!

00:24:06.110 --> 00:24:08.380
The Reason You Were Born"

00:24:07.140 --> 00:24:08.680
"Know it! The Reason You Were Born."

00:24:08.680 --> 00:24:10.340
Watch it, or you're in trouble!
